  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "WCCP: Always validate the address length",
  "description": "The address length has to be validated every time the table\nis dissected, in particular so that a combination of 0 and a\nvery large table length doesn't cause excessive dissection time\nspinning in a large loop.\n\nNote that earlier Wireshark versions will terminate the loop after a\nreasonable amount of time regardless because the table length was stored\nin a 16-bit unsigned integer (despite being a 32-bit value in the packet.)\n\nCf. 847d704e13a6d218abd24fe8fa42dd3e81b82b2e\n\nFix #21028\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
